{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 6720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4140, "text": "Would you listen to me, Doc? I cannot\nperform this operation."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 10460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6940, "text": "I am a lawyer, for God's sake. I was\ntrained to ruin people's lives, not save"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10460, "text": "them."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 13480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12400, "text": "Fielding, you've got to do it."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 14920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13900, "text": "I don't know what I'm doing."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 18280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15220, "text": "Okay, fine, I played doctor once, but\nthen we both took showers and went home."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 22340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19040, "text": "Look, Fielding, if her appendix\nruptures, she could die in the next few"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 24720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22580, "text": "Now, because of you, I can't operate."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 26580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25000, "text": "Well, why me? Why not one of them?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 33940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31440, "text": "Because I need somebody whose first\nlanguage is English so that my every"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 35280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33940, "text": "instruction is understood."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 43660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38440, "text": "Doctor Mooney, radio almost thawed out."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43940, "text": "Oh, great. Now we can get a real doctor\nhere with hands and everything."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 48100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46940, "text": "It's probably broken anyway."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 49800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48380, "text": "Took a hell of a lick when I crashed."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 54160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53060, "text": "No wonder I've got a headache."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 59760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55680, "text": "That water's got to be boiling hot. Doc,\nwould you listen to me? Now look,"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 60780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59780, "text": "Fielding. Buck up."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 62420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61120, "text": "We're depending on you here."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 65500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63400, "text": "I've got a feeling you're going to do a\nhell of a job, too."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 70040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67840, "text": "Okay, okay, fine, fine. I'll do it."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 73440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72440, "text": "Oh, boy."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 75720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73940, "text": "We in deep shupu now."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 82380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78120, "text": "Well, Keita, let's see how you're doing."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 97680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95960, "text": "Ooh, somebody's lunch is in a hurry."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 101360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99120, "text": "You know, you helped me, Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 106600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102180, "text": "One look, I see you're a man of honor\nand decency."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 109740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108220, "text": "Doc, quick, get over here. She's\nhallucinating."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 114960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111880, "text": "That's the anesthetic. A little\nsomething I mixed up myself."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 119620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117060, "text": "I want to go to the Big Apple, Dan\nFielding."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 122180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120120, "text": "I want a tango at the Rainbow Room."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 125170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122910, "text": "I want dinner at Elaine's with Woody and\nMia."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 129770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127050, "text": "No, trust me, he's such a bore since he\nstopped making comedies."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 132810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131810, "text": "Okay,"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 135870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134430, "text": "that's it, Kesa. Just relax, okay?"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 139070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136870, "text": "Relax. Go to sleep, all right?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 143210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 139370, "text": "And when you wake up, everything will be\njust fine."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 146410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144210, "text": "Is that a promise, Dan Fielding?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 148850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147850, "text": "It's a guarantee."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 155190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154190, "text": "I'm going to kill her."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 164170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163010, "text": "Gosh, this is hard."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 166190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 164450, "text": "It's the first eulogy I've ever written."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 171530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168690, "text": "Dear friends, gosh, this is hard."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 175170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172970, "text": "It's the first eulogy I've ever written."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 178970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177090, "text": "Um, excuse me."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 183290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179530, "text": "Would either of you be interested in\ncontributing to a fund to build a"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 184290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183290, "text": "to Dan?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 186110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184550, "text": "Phil, what a wonderful idea."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 191090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 186330, "text": "Yeah. I thought I'd get one of those\nclassy liverware sculptures of him and"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 192450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191090, "text": "it on display in the courtroom."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 194170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193170, "text": "I like it."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 196010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194450, "text": "Sentimental, but good on a cracker."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 198870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197870, "text": "Darn it, sir."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 201230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198890, "text": "Dan deserves better than... Lunch meat?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 203910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202450, "text": "No, the eulogy."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 207590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204370, "text": "Why am I having so much trouble finding\nsomething nice to say about Dan?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 209680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208380, "text": "Hey, I've got an idea."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 213120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 210240, "text": "Remember the time Dan used CPR to save\nmy life?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 216260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213540, "text": "Remember how disappointed he was that\nyou came to so quick?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 223020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218880, "text": "And he insisted that I show my gratitude\nby sleeping with him? Well, when the"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 225140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223020, "text": "moment finally came, he couldn't do it."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 228720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226280, "text": "You mean Dan's spark plug wouldn't fire?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 232200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230520, "text": "No, he was a gentleman."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 236340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232540, "text": "And the fact that he couldn't touch\nme... touched me."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 241550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237089, "text": "Well, that's sweet, but I don't see\nstarting a eulogy with Dan Fielding, the"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 243870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241550, "text": "who couldn't go through with forcing me\ninto bed."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 249290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245950, "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor, I got that\npicture of Dan for the ceremony like you"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 252950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249290, "text": "asked. Great, Bull. Then we're pretty\nmuch all set, except for the eulogy."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 256070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253950, "text": "You don't have any ideas on that, do\nyou?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 257470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256470, "text": "Let's see."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 260990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259290, "text": "Did you mention that Dan was a mammal?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 266710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264590, "text": "Oh, big guy, that one flipped right by\nus."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 269370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267470, "text": "That's what I'm here for, sir."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 274230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272270, "text": "Let me take a crack at that."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 280250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277790, "text": "Dan Fielding was..."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 295760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294120, "text": "All right, Fielding. It's showtime."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 297760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296540, "text": "Kameelama. Scalpel."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 300560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299560, "text": "Shiny."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 302280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301280, "text": "And sharp."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 307780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303540, "text": "Now, we start by making an oblique\nincision right here down to the"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 309960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307840, "text": "just above the pelvic bone at McBurney's\npoint."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 313780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310580, "text": "At McBurney's point? You know, I hear\nit's lovely this time of the year. Come"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 316280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313780, "text": "on, Fielding. Strike her right here."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 319020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316500, "text": "About four inches long, quarter of an\ninch deep."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 342190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341170, "text": "Okay. All right."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 343810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342810, "text": "Yep."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 344990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343990, "text": "Operating now."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 347370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346370, "text": "There."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 348690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347690, "text": "Very good."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 351450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348990, "text": "Now, this time, let's try and actually\nbreak the skin."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 355310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353930, "text": "I'm afraid you were going to say that."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 359230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357170, "text": "All right. Now, easy does it. Just be\ncareful."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 361690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360690, "text": "There you go."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 362790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361790, "text": "There you go."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 367470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365530, "text": "Uh -huh. This isn't so bad."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 369350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368350, "text": "It's not..."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 376900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374580, "text": "Inside a human? Well, don't that beat\nall."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 382360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379860, "text": "Easy, Fielding. You're doing just fine\nthere."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 385900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383780, "text": "Boy, I'll never forget my first\noperation."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 391940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386580, "text": "When I stared into that mass of\npulsating gelatinous goo, I almost"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 392940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391940, "text": "my surgical mask."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 396740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395440, "text": "Gee, I feel better."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 399460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398100, "text": "I mean, Lama, his brow."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 402100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400159, "text": "Very handsome, like Brow of Eagle."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 405900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403600, "text": "Why don't you try wiping Brow of Eagle?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 409520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407740, "text": "Now, just lift up the cecum there."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 412980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410140, "text": "Now, you see a little worm -like thing\nright at the end of it? About three or"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 415560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412980, "text": "four inches long? Ah, that's it. That's\nthe appendix. How's it look?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 418820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416180, "text": "Oh, gee, cute as a button. I think it's\na waste we wear these on the inside."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 421820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419960, "text": "You mean, what color is it?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 427040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422120, "text": "Red. Well, excuse me, but I think I am\nthe one doing the operating here."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 430710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429710, "text": "Bright red."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 433710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431530, "text": "That means it's inflamed. It's got to\ncome out for sure."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 434930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433930, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 436710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435390, "text": "Clamp it off at the base there."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 438110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437110, "text": "Clamp."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 441990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440950, "text": "No, no."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 443270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442270, "text": "Clamp."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 449169, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448190, "text": "That's perfect."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 452450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449170, "text": "All right. Now take the scissors and lop\nthat little troublemaker off before it"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 453450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452450, "text": "ruptures. Scissors."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 458430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457050, "text": "Just be careful."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 460810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459470, "text": "You can make a clean cut."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 464450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461610, "text": "One false snip and it's curtains for\nKeaston."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 468590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467590, "text": "No pressure."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 480510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474470, "text": "Oh, boy."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 482810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481810, "text": "Oh, boy."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 485610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483070, "text": "Oh, boy. Oh, boy. Oh, boy. Oh, boy."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 490930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488110, "text": "These hands just touch to human beings'\nintestines."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 495450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493090, "text": "Don't you guys ever say I don't take you\nanywhere, okay?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 500170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498150, "text": "Doc, is she awake? No, no, not yet."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 503110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500690, "text": "Here, why don't you take a pull -off of\nthis? Make you feel better."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 504770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503770, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 508070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507070, "text": "What the hell?"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 511090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509850, "text": "Neil, what is this?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 513190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512190, "text": "Moose juice."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 515210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514210, "text": "Actually, not bad."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 517530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516530, "text": "Al Fielding."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 518850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517850, "text": "Hell of a job in there."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 520109, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519289, "text": "Oh, yeah?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 521110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520110, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 524230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521210, "text": "Good. It means we saved her. Oh, she\nwould have died for sure."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 527150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524750, "text": "Now she's got a solid 50 -50 chance."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 532570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529290, "text": "50 -50? Well, it's not bad when you\noperate on the same table where you"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 533570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532570, "text": "fish."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 537050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535070, "text": "Ah, careful. Not too much of that stuff."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 541310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537530, "text": "I once chugged a bucket of that. I ended\nup in Saskatoon wearing pasties and wig"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 542310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541310, "text": "tips."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 546470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543770, "text": "Um, do you mind if I have a few minutes\nalone with..."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 548020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546860, "text": "Shuttle Bullwinkle, please."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 550640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548900, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 555440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554120, "text": "Okay, come on, Fielding."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 557600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556600, "text": "Relax here."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 562080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558460, "text": "After all, you only did what was right."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 563520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562520, "text": "Right?"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 565060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564060, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 567240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566240, "text": "Right?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 569360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567780, "text": "You are listening to this, aren't you?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 573040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570520, "text": "Well, if you are, I have just one\nquestion."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 575700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573860, "text": "What did I do to deserve this?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 577860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576860, "text": "Don't answer that."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 582640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580000, "text": "You know something? I'm going to tell\nyou right now, though. It's not entirely"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 584240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582640, "text": "my fault, this lifestyle I lead."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 585920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584920, "text": "Women, for instance."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 593260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586340, "text": "I mean, you didn't have to make women\nso... Well, so... Could"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 595200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593260, "text": "have given them a trunk, a tusk."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 598820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597380, "text": "Not that that would have stopped me."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 604540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601840, "text": "So, listen, what's the story? Do you\nfeel some kind of need to punish me?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 606170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605170, "text": "Well, fine, fine."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 608650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606230, "text": "Punish me. I mean, send out a boil or\ntwo. I can take it."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 611170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609170, "text": "But you don't put them on the face\nanymore, do you?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 617070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612630, "text": "Doesn't matter. I can handle it. Just...\nDon't take it out on Kista."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 622310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621310, "text": "Listen."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 630050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629050, "text": "I'll tell you what I'll do."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 634070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631130, "text": "If you let Kista live, I promise..."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 645910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643690, "text": "Boy, it always comes down to this,\ndoesn't it?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 650430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647230, "text": "This is where I say I'll be good from\nnow on."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 653110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650830, "text": "Well, forget it."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 656370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654110, "text": "You and I know what I'm capable of."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 658890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657890, "text": "Look."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 667950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661050, "text": "If you let Keister live, I promise I'll"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 668970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667950, "text": "try to be a little better."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 672650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671650, "text": "Okay?"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 682730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677569, "text": "Okay. Oh, and if you just happen to\nthink about getting around to it, would"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 684230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682730, "text": "get me the hell out of here?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 688110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687110, "text": "Doc,"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 690010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689010, "text": "what is it?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 691570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690030, "text": "You ever sit on a set of antlers?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 695250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694250, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 698710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697650, "text": "Keith, you're awake."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 701270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699030, "text": "You're doing fine, Fielding.\nTemperature's normal."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 702760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701680, "text": "Vital signs are all good."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 704560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703560, "text": "She's gonna make it."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 711300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704880, "text": "Oh, we did it. That must hurt."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 712560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711560, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 716240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712660, "text": "Oh, pain shot all the way up to here.\nOh, thanks."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 720040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719020, "text": "Dan Fielding?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 722680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720340, "text": "Yes, Keister, you're feeling better?"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 725420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723320, "text": "Gordon Mooney say you saved my life."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 729980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725800, "text": "Oh, well, it's nothing more than any\nother decent, courageous..."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 732640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730620, "text": "A remarkably attractive man would have\ndone."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 739120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734560, "text": "I never thought that when I first see\nthe sleeping stranger, that he would"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 740200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739120, "text": "out my appendix."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 743600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741260, "text": "Well, gee, I hope you don't think that\nwas too forward of me."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 748920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745480, "text": "We had to make sure you got better so\nyou could come visit me in New York"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 751320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749360, "text": "Maybe Nami Lama come visit you, too."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 755000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 752540, "text": "Oh, sure, you can sleep in the fridge so\nyou don't get homesick."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 760609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759790, "text": "What happened?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 761870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760610, "text": "Oxbow, get radio working."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 763470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762210, "text": "Ah, excuse me. Excuse me."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 768630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764590, "text": "Oxbow. I love you. You're a beautiful\nman. I love you. How did you get it to"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 771570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768630, "text": "work? Come on, find the switch. Turn it\non."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 774970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773230, "text": "I guess that's why he chief."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 779190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776270, "text": "Hello? Hello, this is Gordon Mooney. Can\nanybody hear me?"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 780850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779850, "text": "I got somebody."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 782870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781870, "text": "I'm going home."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 784070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783070, "text": "I'm going home."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 786370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784310, "text": "Hey, guys, I am going home."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 790730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787750, "text": "Listen, you lugs, too, I'm not going to\nforget you. When I get back, I'm sending"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 792410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790730, "text": "back gifts. Breath mints for everybody."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 798750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794170, "text": "And you, little lady, as soon as you get\nbetter, I'm sending you a plane ticket"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 799970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798750, "text": "and you're coming to New York."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 804850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800790, "text": "I said I'd write."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 809470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808470, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 813090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812090, "text": "this must be the place."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 820810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817550, "text": "You get the feeling nobody's getting\nlucky in New York City tonight?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 824150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822850, "text": "Well, how's it going?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 828770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824630, "text": "Wally's got them primed and ready to go.\nThere wasn't a dry eye on the house"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 830970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828770, "text": "when he played Roll Out the Coffin."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 836390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833290, "text": "My God, can you believe all these are\nfor Dan?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 838330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837070, "text": "Rest in peace, Dan."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 840530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838650, "text": "Your friends at Bob's Battery City."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 844490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843490, "text": "Afternoon, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 845730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844730, "text": "Hi, Phil."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 846459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845800, "text": "What's this?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 849540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 846460, "text": "It's a copy of Dan's favorite letter to\nPenthouse."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 852320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851140, "text": "I had it framed."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 855100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852860, "text": "I think Dan would have wanted it this\nway."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 858420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856060, "text": "I know Dan would have wanted it this\nway."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 864340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861380, "text": "So what do you say we take a seat and\nget started, huh?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 867500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866340, "text": "Good afternoon, everybody."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 871640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868400, "text": "For those of you who don't know me, I'm\nJudge Harold T. Stone."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 881390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880010, "text": "Well, I guess some of you do know me."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 890010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883590, "text": "Each of us here today had his or her own\nspecial relationship"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 891650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890010, "text": "with Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 898250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892390, "text": "Friend, acquaintance, business\nassociate."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 906710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900710, "text": "We are not here to mourn the passing of\nthe man as much as we are here to"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 908690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906710, "text": "celebrate his life."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 916060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911020, "text": "I think we can all agree that Dan\nFielding was a wonderful man."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 919200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918200, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 924260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921760, "text": "then we can agree that he had\noutstanding qualities."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 927280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926280, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 933060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929320, "text": "certainly we can agree that he was tall."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 940160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937380, "text": "I'll be expanding on that height thing\nas the..."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 941480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940480, "text": "Service continues."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 945020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941880, "text": "Right now, does anyone want to get up\nand say something about Dan?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 947500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946160, "text": "I'd like to say something."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 950780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947700, "text": "Yes, the lady in the canine wear."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 956980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952880, "text": "Dan was one of the most thoughtful,\nsensitive men I ever knew."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 961360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958840, "text": "The two of us had many shared interests."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 963380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962120, "text": "In fact..."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 968240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963820, "text": "One of Dan's favorite things was when\nI'd put my legs behind my neck."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 969940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968620, "text": "Well, thank you."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 979160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973660, "text": "For that nearly inspirational thought."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 982120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980200, "text": "All right, who's next?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 988160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987160, "text": "Mac."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 995820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994160, "text": "You want to see what you know about Dan?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 999280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998080, "text": "In front of everybody?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1002360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001120, "text": "Mac, help me out."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1007560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003540, "text": "Let me see."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1012100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010180, "text": "Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1016540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013860, "text": "Well, he always kept his fingernails\nnicely trimmed."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1019420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018420, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1022700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021120, "text": "Who was this Fielding guy?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1025490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023130, "text": "I've seen people get more choked up\nflushing goldfish."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1029050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027170, "text": "Buddy, he was my friend."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1032310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030510, "text": "We were all Dan's friends."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1038410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033310, "text": "And sure, it's tough for us to\narticulate how we felt about him because"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1039410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038410, "text": "special."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1042230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039790, "text": "Dan Fielding was more than just an\nattorney."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1044750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042910, "text": "He was more than just a man."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1050990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045630, "text": "Dan Fielding was... a mammal."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1057240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056240, "text": "That was mine."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1062660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059620, "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor, I have something\nto say. Please, Ross."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1066520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065520, "text": "Can I help you?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1070920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066960, "text": "Yes, I'm here for the funeral of a\nwonderful, warm, substantial man."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1073060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071380, "text": "Sorry, this is the fielding, sir."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1082480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076160, "text": "The Dan Fielding I knew was a self\n-centered, egotistical, boot -licking..."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1086510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083110, "text": "Disgustingly perverted sack of slime in\na $500 suit."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1090090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088710, "text": "She can't say that."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1092210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090650, "text": "Put a sock in it, Furface."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1099730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096590, "text": "Dan's every action had an ulterior\nmotive."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1105150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100550, "text": "If he gave you the shirt off his back,\nyou can bet his pants and underwear"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1106150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105150, "text": "quickly follow."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1114100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111920, "text": "But I also remember another Dan\nFielding."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1121480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114920, "text": "In a time when I went into insulin\nshock, I was on a ledge, hallucinating."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1125260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122760, "text": "Without regard for his own personal\nsafety,"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1128840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126180, "text": "Dan Fielding saved my life."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1133180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130540, "text": "Yes, Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1138460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134600, "text": "The same man who has the length of his\ntongue printed on his business card."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1157430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151850, "text": "Because of Dan, that I'm able to be here\nto badmouth him today."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1162550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161290, "text": "I miss you, Dan."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1169090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167870, "text": "We all miss Dan."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1173730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172290, "text": "And that is why we're here."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1176970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175150, "text": "Because he was a part of our lives."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1184770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180750, "text": "And maybe that's all that needs to be\nsaid."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1189150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187950, "text": "I tell it is."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1191610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190310, "text": "Would you shut up, Dan?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1193490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191830, "text": "I'm trying to... Dan!"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1196930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195930, "text": "You're alive!"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1200530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199530, "text": "Huggies!"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1206270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204210, "text": "Don't expect a refund just because he's\nalive."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1209170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208170, "text": "Guys, I can't breathe."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1211650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209690, "text": "And whoever groped me, thanks."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1214990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213230, "text": "Dad, they told us you were dead."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1219250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215470, "text": "Nearly. I was rescued by a seal and\nnursed back to health by an enormous"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1220250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219250, "text": "lady."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1222090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220350, "text": "These cod liver all in an enema."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1226890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223930, "text": "Hey, look, what do you say we go to\nMcCann's and celebrate? You can fill us"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1227890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226890, "text": "on all the details."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1230390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228030, "text": "Will you ladies join us?"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1233750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230950, "text": "Geez, Dan, first you're dead, now you're\nalive."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1236310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233990, "text": "I hate a man who can't make a\ncommitment."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1241880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1239500, "text": "Kathy, Candy, Bambi, Mindy, Cindy."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1243920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242920, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1247660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244640, "text": "I've got so much to share with you. I've\nlearned how to gut a fish and tie up a"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1248660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247660, "text": "dog team."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1250940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249940, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1255140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251120, "text": "look, let's blow this joint. Let's hear\nsome of those stories. Yeah, let's go."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1257100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255960, "text": "The dead guy's buying."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1260100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258820, "text": "You know, I had a beard once."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1262100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261100, "text": "Why'd you shave it off?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1263780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262780, "text": "Shave it off?"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1267200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265820, "text": "That would have been a lot easier."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1273800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272560, "text": "I'm glad you're back, Dan."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1276980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275980, "text": "Missed me, huh?"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1281920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278480, "text": "Yeah, I was beginning to believe that\nwhat I wore under my clothing was my"}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1282920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281920, "text": "business."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1284780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283780, "text": "Perish the thought."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1292880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287180, "text": "Dan, I know we've had our differences,\nbut... When I thought that you were"}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1299900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293040, "text": "I felt so... So... But"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1300900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299900, "text": "now that you're..."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1309629, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308629, "text": "Tissue time."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1315110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313250, "text": "I missed you, pal."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1317770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315310, "text": "Oh, God, Harry, I missed you, too."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1324750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318750, "text": "Dan, you... You... You really"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1325790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324750, "text": "stink."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1331810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328850, "text": "Yeah, I know, but it's nothing that a\nbar of soap in a belt center won't fix."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1336820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333520, "text": "So it was weird trying to put together a\nmemorial service for you."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1340420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337040, "text": "Memorial? Is that what you call this?\nThis wasn't a memorial, Harry. It was a"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1341420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340420, "text": "roast."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1345160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343080, "text": "What's the matter? Slappy white and red\nbuttons weren't available?"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1350400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346480, "text": "Well, you know, you're not exactly an\neasy guy to sum up in a couple of words."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1354580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350660, "text": "I mean, what do you say about a man who\none minute is saving someone's life and"}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1358080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354580, "text": "the next minute is taking bets on a\nnun's bra size?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1361720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360200, "text": "Well, I am what I am."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1368010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1363390, "text": "Yeah, well, whatever it is that you is,\nit's good to have it back."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1371190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368550, "text": "Thanks, Henry. It is great to be back."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1373030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1371590, "text": "Must have been hell up north."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1377250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1373490, "text": "Oh, yeah, but you know what? It had its\nmoment, too. And there was. This cute"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1380370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377250, "text": "little number up there, she'd have\nknocked your socks off, I tell you. I"}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1383030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380370, "text": "her that as soon as she gets to New\nYork, she's got to come and visit me."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1390010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384790, "text": "She got a sister?"}
